 "notes": "1v1, 180-degree rotation: tile (x,y) pairs with (79-x,79-y). Three lanes: two 6-wide ring roads and a wide diagonal middle with the Angel Wreck at the exact centre. Each side: 24-tile home field, a 16-tile natural in a pocket behind a 4-wide choke on its ring lane, and an equidistant 16-tile mid expansion in the far corner. A 3-wide alley on each side cuts from the ring lane to the middle through a plague pocket: a Horde shortcut that Survivors avoid.",
